// #80 FOLLOW-UP — THE NULL-TYPE PLACE-SLOT DECLINE, EXECUTED.
//
// `MLIRGenImpl::place_slot_type` decides the byte size of a PLACE: an array /
// Vec element stride, a GEP into an aggregate, and — since #80 — the slot of a
// deferred `let v: T;`. Asked with a NULL TypeRef it used to answer `i32`: a
// FOUR-byte place for a type the caller could not name, smaller than every fat
// repr and than most scalars, so the stride / GEP / slot built from it is wrong
// in the direction that OVERWRITES THE NEIGHBOUR — the #80 defect's own shape.
// It is now a report on the `bug` channel ⇒ COMPILE FAILED, no object file.
//
// THE ARM WAS ALSO REACHED, ONCE, BY CORRECT CODE. `gen_lvalue_addr`'s
// IndexRead case computed the element stride EAGERLY, before dispatching on the
// receiver kind — and `TypeRef(Ptr/Ref).elem()` is null, so the two
// pointer-receiver arms (which then compute their own stride from the POINTEE)
// asked with null and threw the answer away. Harmless while the answer was a
// silent guess; a false report once the guess became a decline. Measured on
// `pass/bc_fatval_deferred_init_len` — one fire — and closed by making the ask
// LAZY, per receiver arm. The stride the two pointer arms actually use is
// unchanged; the speculative ask is gone.
//
// AFTER THAT, THE ARM FIRES NOWHERE IN THE TREE — which is the point and the
// problem: a report no program executes is a green nobody ran (exactly what
// `check_slot_fits` was caught being, see `fail/mlirgen_slot_fits_sensor`). The
// measurement needs no fire counter that could go stale: the sink FAILS THE
// COMPILE, so the green stdlib+examples build and the green fixture corpus
// could not be hiding a fire.
//
// This file executes it through the name-scoped fault injection in
// `declare_local_place`: a local named `__slotnull_canary*` asks
// `place_slot_type` once with a null type. Its sibling
// `fail/mlirgen_place_slot_decline` pins the OTHER decline (the struct-key
// miss) — one prefix per arm, because the fail runner greps the whole
// `.expected` as a FIXED pattern and a two-line expectation is an OR. Delete
// this decline, or the injection, and this file goes green-by-silence — logosc
// succeeds, stderr carries nothing, and the fail runner reds it.
//
// THE ADMIT HALF OF THE PAIR: the same declaration with an ordinary name is
// `pass/bc_fatval_deferred_init_len` cell 1 — it compiles and answers 5.
package mlirgen_place_slot_null_decline;

unsafe fn main() -> i32 {
    let __slotnull_canary_v: str;
    __slotnull_canary_v = "abcde";
    if __slotnull_canary_v.len() != 5i64 { return 1; }
    return 0;
}
